Preserve queued input when entering and leaving native drags.

SDL_SetEventFilter discards the entire event queue, including a button release
that may already follow the press. Window, scrollbar, and slider drags must
consume that release. Process their motion normally without a global filter;
the widget handlers already calculate changes from their previous positions.

